title: explorer-electricity-reliability
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-01

authors:
  - family-names: Case
    given-names: Denise M.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6165-7389"
    affiliation: "Northwest Missouri State University, School of Computer Science and Information Systems, Maryville, MO, USA"

repository-code: "https://github.com/civic-interconnect/explorer-electricity-reliability"
url: "https://github.com/civic-interconnect/explorer-electricity-reliability"

license: Apache-2.0

abstract: >
  An open explorer for annual U.S. electric utility reliability
  data, including SAIDI, SAIFI, and CAIDI, with methods, definitions,
  and reporting limitations explained. The data originate with U.S.
  Energy Information Administration Form EIA-861 and are processed
  and published by Catalyst Cooperative's PUDL project.

keywords:
  - electricity
  - utility reliability
  - EIA-861
  - PUDL
  - SAIDI
  - SAIFI
  - CAIDI
  - open data
